OL,3,AMore flight cancellations as fallout
OL,4,Afrom air traffic control glitch
OL,5,Acontinues
OL,6,
OL,7,FAir passengers faced a second day of
OL,8,Fdisruption on Wednesday as flights
OL,9,Fcontinued to be cancelled following a
OL,10,Ftechnical glitch with the UK's traffic
OL,11,Fcontrol system.
OL,13,FTens of thousands of people saw their
OL,14,Ftravel plans upended as airlines
OL,15,Fcancelled 327 flights, according to
OL,16,Faviation analytics firm Cirium, after
OL,17,F1,750 flights were axed on Tuesday
OL,18,Fafter the problem emerged.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
