OL,3,AMore flight cancellations as fallout
OL,4,Afrom air traffic control glitch
OL,5,Acontinues
OL,6,
OL,7,FNats, the air traffic control provider,
OL,8,Fapologised and said on Wednesday
OL,9,Fafternoon its operations were "stable".
OL,10,FIt promised an investigation into what
OL,11,Fis its third major technical fault in
OL,12,Fthree years.
OL,14,FThe government said Nats' boss has its
OL,15,Fconfidence though Foreign Secretary Ed
OL,16,FMiliband said the outage was
OL,17,F"unacceptable".
